You must have been very nervous.

00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:46.999
There must have been pressure.

00:33:47.000 --> 00:33:47.999
There definitely was.

00:33:48.000 --> 00:33:48.999
Tell us honestly.

00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:49.999
