00:34:58.000 --> 00:34:59.999
After that, I begin singing

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:02.999
without accompaniment.

00:35:03.000 --> 00:35:03.999
Right, with nothing playing.

00:35:04.000 --> 00:35:06.999
Yes. But I was a little disappointed.

00:35:07.000 --> 00:35:07.999
Why? >> In what way?

00:35:08.000 --> 00:35:09.999
I could have done better.

00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:11.999
At the very beginning of a concert,

00:35:12.000 --> 00:35:14.999
