00:35:16.000 --> 00:35:17.999
Once I start and work up a sweat,

00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:18.999
my voice warms up.

00:35:19.000 --> 00:35:19.999
At the beginning...

00:35:20.000 --> 00:35:22.999
So my tone was a little heavy,

00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:25.999
and I thought I sounded like a bird.

00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:26.999
That was disappointing.

00:35:27.000 --> 00:35:28.999
Birdsong is cool.

00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:29.999
Anyway, that's how it was.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:30.999
Okay. Yes.

00:35:31.000 --> 00:35:32.999
Anyway, I thought it was very cool.

00:35:33.000 --> 00:35:34.999
It felt like the arrow went bang

00:35:35.000 --> 00:35:35.999
