PLLI and we sang it together,

00:40:52.000 --> 00:40:54.999
right? How was it?

00:40:55.000 --> 00:40:57.999
How was PLLI's singing?

00:40:58.000 --> 00:41:00.999
Yes, but PLLI...

00:41:01.000 --> 00:41:01.999
How was it?

00:41:02.000 --> 00:41:03.999
It sounded like they'd practiced a lot.

00:41:04.000 --> 00:41:04.999
Right.

00:41:05.000 --> 00:41:05.999
They must have listened that much.

00:41:06.000 --> 00:41:06.999
Exactly.

00:41:07.000 --> 00:41:08.999
You can listen to it many times,

00:41:09.000 --> 00:41:10.999
