00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:27.999
And we did some content for it.

00:41:28.000 --> 00:41:29.999
Right.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:30.999
We did that...

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:32.999
The karaoke content.

00:41:33.000 --> 00:41:36.999
'Sing Together, PLLI.' Right, practice.

00:41:37.000 --> 00:41:38.999
Yes, we said it. Right, right.

00:41:39.000 --> 00:41:41.999
We did. >> You sang so well. They say they were nervous

00:41:42.000 --> 00:41:42.999
while singing 'Hmpf!'

00:41:43.000 --> 00:41:43.999
Really?

00:41:44.000 --> 00:41:44.999
They were nervous.

00:41:45.000 --> 00:41:45.999
Of course they were.

00:41:46.000 --> 00:41:47.999
They say they were nervous. >> They worked hard.

00:41:48.000 --> 00:41:49.999
They even took calming pills.

00:41:50.000 --> 00:41:51.999
They sang well. >> They took calming pills.

00:41:52.000 --> 00:41:53.999
That can happen.

00:41:54.000 --> 00:41:54.999
It can.

00:41:55.000 --> 00:41:55.999
Please keep it up in the future.

00:41:56.000 --> 00:41:57.999
Yes, we'll ask this of you again.

00:41:58.000 --> 00:42:02.999
It was wonderful hearing you sing like that.

00:42:03.000 --> 00:42:04.999
Beyond the singing, what I love

00:42:05.000 --> 00:42:06.999
about concerts is always communicating

00:42:07.000 --> 00:42:08.999
