00:42:09.000 --> 00:42:10.999
So lately I've been giving you

00:42:11.000 --> 00:42:11.999
various missions.

00:42:12.000 --> 00:42:12.999
Lots of missions.

00:42:13.000 --> 00:42:14.999
I've given you many. Yes.

00:42:15.000 --> 00:42:16.999
What were they? There were two.

00:42:17.000 --> 00:42:18.999
First, the greeting.

00:42:19.000 --> 00:42:20.999
And during 'Pump Up The Volume!'

00:42:21.000 --> 00:42:22.999
when we count one, two, we do it together.

00:42:23.000 --> 00:42:25.999
I'd love to do more things like that

00:42:26.000 --> 00:42:27.999
in the future. Yes.

00:42:28.000 --> 00:42:28.999
That's what I thought.

00:42:29.000 --> 00:42:29.999
I thought that was fun.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:31.999
Yes. I should try it too.

00:42:32.000 --> 00:42:32.999
That suddenly reminds me of something.

00:42:33.000 --> 00:42:34.999
What?

00:42:35.000 --> 00:42:39.999
Someone said hyung's aegyo gave them hives.

00:42:40.000 --> 00:42:40.999
That.

00:42:41.000 --> 00:42:42.999
Ah.

00:42:43.000 --> 00:42:44.999
I suddenly remembered it.

00:42:45.000 --> 00:42:47.999
That was private...

00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:48.999
Hives...

00:42:49.000 --> 00:42:50.999
Was it because I did too much aegyo?

00:42:51.000 --> 00:42:51.999
They said they might break out in hives.

00:42:52.000 --> 00:42:53.999
Ah.

00:42:54.000 --> 00:42:55.999
But I won't be discouraged.

00:42:56.000 --> 00:42:57.999
I'll do even more.

00:42:58.000 --> 00:42:59.999
More aegyo?

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:01.999
Then I'll do even more too.

00:43:02.000 --> 00:43:03.999
It just came to mind.

00:43:04.000 --> 00:43:05.999
That's right. I suddenly remembered it.

00:43:06.000 --> 00:43:07.999
