00:43:21.000 --> 00:43:22.999
Something cool—bang!

00:43:23.000 --> 00:43:25.999
Just doing something cool...

00:43:26.000 --> 00:43:27.999
The line itself was cool.

00:43:28.000 --> 00:43:29.999
He must practice a lot at home.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:31.999
I'm only saying this because I'm worried.

00:43:32.000 --> 00:43:33.999
You need to kick with the other side too.

