00:43:52.000 --> 00:43:53.999
You really do.

00:43:54.000 --> 00:43:54.999
So...

00:43:55.000 --> 00:43:55.999
Really? >> Yes. For me...

00:43:56.000 --> 00:43:57.999
It's to avoid injury.

