No, I didn't.

01:39:03.000 --> 01:39:04.999
We were monitoring continuously.

01:39:05.000 --> 01:39:06.999
I kept dancing without knowing.

01:39:07.000 --> 01:39:09.999
Right. The incident happened,

01:39:10.000 --> 01:39:11.999
and Bamby collapsed. We had to decide

01:39:12.000 --> 01:39:13.999
whether to do it one more time

01:39:14.000 --> 01:39:14.999
or move on.

01:39:15.000 --> 01:39:15.999
We had to make that decision.

01:39:16.000 --> 01:39:17.999
But his wishes mattered too.

01:39:18.000 --> 01:39:21.999
The lead came over and asked,

01:39:22.000 --> 01:39:23.999
'Bamby, what do you want to do? Can you do it?'

01:39:24.000 --> 01:39:24.999
I can do it.

01:39:25.000 --> 01:39:26.999
'Bamby, can you do it?'

01:39:27.000 --> 01:39:27.999
I can.

01:39:28.000 --> 01:39:29.999
You know what it reminded me of?

01:39:30.000 --> 01:39:32.999
A wrestling match.

01:39:33.000 --> 01:39:34.999
One, two...

01:39:35.000 --> 01:39:37.999
In MMA or UFC, asking,

01:39:38.000 --> 01:39:39.999
'Can you continue?' >> 'I can.'

01:39:40.000 --> 01:39:40.999
'Are you okay?'

01:39:41.000 --> 01:39:44.999
It was like that.

01:39:45.000 --> 01:39:48.999
He was down, and they asked if he could continue.

01:39:49.000 --> 01:39:51.999
Bamby was in rough shape and said, 'Ja,

01:39:52.000 --> 01:39:53.999
'Give me ten seconds. Just ten seconds.'

01:39:54.000 --> 01:39:56.999
They kept asking if he could do it,

01:39:57.000 --> 01:39:58.999
and he kept saying, 'Ten seconds.'

01:39:59.000 --> 01:40:07.999
He meant he'd do it after ten seconds.

01:40:08.000 --> 01:40:09.999
Seriously.

01:40:10.000 --> 01:40:12.999
Wow, I thought that was so cool.

01:40:13.000 --> 01:40:13.999
And he actually pulled it off.

01:40:14.000 --> 01:40:14.999
Exactly.

01:40:15.000 --> 01:40:16.999
Seriously. Honestly,

01:40:17.000 --> 01:40:17.999
I thought the second performance

01:40:18.000 --> 01:40:20.999
would be a little gentler

01:40:21.000 --> 01:40:22.999
because he was exhausted.

01:40:23.000 --> 01:40:24.999
But he went even harder.

01:40:25.000 --> 01:40:26.999
Genuine respect. So cool.

01:40:27.000 --> 01:40:28.999
Talking about it now again makes me feel

01:40:29.000 --> 01:40:29.999
that some things are meant to happen.

01:40:30.000 --> 01:40:30.999
You always did 'Sherlock' three times.

01:40:31.000 --> 01:40:31.999
Right.

01:40:32.000 --> 01:40:32.999
Exactly.

01:40:33.000 --> 01:40:34.999
I think there's meaning in that.

01:40:35.000 --> 01:40:36.999
The reason you did it three times was created then.

01:40:37.000 --> 01:40:37.999
Exactly.

01:40:38.000 --> 01:40:38.999
This is 'The Truman Show.'

01:40:39.000 --> 01:40:39.999
Exactly.

01:40:40.000 --> 01:40:41.999
But in that moment,

01:40:42.000 --> 01:40:43.999
when I heard there had been an incident...

01:40:44.000 --> 01:40:45.999
As soon as I finished, we were all using oxygen,

01:40:46.000 --> 01:40:48.999
breathing like this,

01:40:49.000 --> 01:40:50.999
and then I heard there'd been a problem.

01:40:51.000 --> 01:40:53.999
'Why me? Why again?'

01:40:54.000 --> 01:40:56.999
'Why does this keep happening to me?'

01:40:57.000 --> 01:40:59.999
But they kept asking whether I'd do it.

01:41:00.000 --> 01:41:03.999
For an instant, I wondered if I should.

01:41:04.000 --> 01:41:04.999
I got angry: 'Why did this happen to me?'

01:41:05.000 --> 01:41:05.999
Then...

01:41:06.000 --> 01:41:07.999
In that moment, I thought,

01:41:08.000 --> 01:41:09.999
'I need to show them what I've prepared.

01:41:10.000 --> 01:41:12.999
I need to show what I've done.'

01:41:13.000 --> 01:41:13.999
That thought came into my eyes.

01:41:14.000 --> 01:41:14.999
I said, 'Let's go.'

01:41:15.000 --> 01:41:16.999
That's what happened. And then the members...

01:41:17.000 --> 01:41:19.999
At the time...

01:41:20.000 --> 01:41:20.999
You looked like you were dying.

01:41:21.000 --> 01:41:23.999
It was my final stage,

01:41:24.000 --> 01:41:24.999
and I intended to show everything.

01:41:25.000 --> 01:41:26.999
The incident happened at the very end,

01:41:27.000 --> 01:41:27.999
so I had already spent all my energy

01:41:28.000 --> 01:41:30.999
in those three minutes.

01:41:31.000 --> 01:41:33.999
But then the members—Hamin...

01:41:34.000 --> 01:41:35.999
while I lay there, he said, 'Hyung,

01:41:36.000 --> 01:41:36.999
just sing. Only sing.'

01:41:37.000 --> 01:41:37.999
Ah.

01:41:38.000 --> 01:41:39.999
But I knew he wouldn't do that.

01:41:40.000 --> 01:41:41.999
Given hyung's personality, only singing

01:41:42.000 --> 01:41:43.999
would have been impossible.

01:41:44.000 --> 01:41:46.999
All of us told him to just sing instead.

01:41:47.000 --> 01:41:48.999
Right, since you'd already shown

01:41:49.000 --> 01:41:49.999
a mixture of everything.

01:41:50.000 --> 01:41:51.999
Mix it up and enjoy it.

01:41:52.000 --> 01:41:53.999
Honestly, I intended to do that at first.

01:41:54.000 --> 01:41:54.999
But then...

01:41:55.000 --> 01:41:56.999
PLLI shouted 'Bamby is back'

01:41:57.000 --> 01:41:57.999
so loudly.

01:41:58.000 --> 01:41:58.999
As Bamby...

01:41:59.000 --> 01:41:59.999
I couldn't resist.

01:42:00.000 --> 01:42:00.999
Before I knew it...

01:42:01.000 --> 01:42:04.999
I went for it.

01:42:05.000 --> 01:42:05.999
I don't know.

01:42:06.000 --> 01:42:06.999
My muscles simply moved on their own.

01:42:07.000 --> 01:42:08.999
Right, right.

01:42:09.000 --> 01:42:10.999
The muscles I'd trained

01:42:11.000 --> 01:42:11.999
took over.

01:42:12.000 --> 01:42:13.999
Right. It was a moving performance.

01:42:14.000 --> 01:42:14.999
But it was so...

01:42:15.000 --> 01:42:15.999
I didn't know 'Sherlock' was so sad.

01:42:16.000 --> 01:42:18.999
Me neither.

01:42:19.000 --> 01:42:19.999
A song with such a story.

01:42:20.000 --> 01:42:21.999
When you said, 'Are you really ready?'

01:42:22.000 --> 01:42:23.999
there was something I wanted to ask hyung.

01:42:24.000 --> 01:42:25.999
Were you truly ready?

01:42:26.000 --> 01:42:27.999
That was something I wanted to ask myself too.

01:42:28.000 --> 01:42:31.999
PLLI... But honestly,

01:42:32.000 --> 01:42:32.999
during the first 'Sherlock'

01:42:33.000 --> 01:42:34.999
on the final day,

01:42:35.000 --> 01:42:36.999
I'd prepared everything, including

01:42:37.000 --> 01:42:38.999
'Are you ready, PLLI?' Right?

01:42:39.000 --> 01:42:41.999
I'd also prepared the gestures

01:42:42.000 --> 01:42:42.999
during [Singing].

01:42:43.000 --> 01:42:43.999
I think every gesture was planned.

01:42:44.000 --> 01:42:44.999
Exactly. It looked cool—cameras and all.

01:42:45.000 --> 01:42:45.999
The angles as well.

01:42:46.000 --> 01:42:47.999
When I had to perform it again,

01:42:48.000 --> 01:42:49.999
I'd already used all those gestures.

01:42:50.000 --> 01:42:50.999
I had no new ones left.

01:42:51.000 --> 01:42:52.999
So I kept wondering what to do.

01:42:53.000 --> 01:42:55.999
And although it wasn't exactly my fault,

01:42:56.000 --> 01:42:57.999
there had been an incident.

01:42:58.000 --> 01:42:59.999
I felt sorry toward the people

01:43:00.000 --> 01:43:02.999
who had come to watch.

01:43:03.000 --> 01:43:04.999
It would have been better if I'd completed it perfectly.

01:43:05.000 --> 01:43:07.999
So I did a little aegyo.

01:43:08.000 --> 01:43:09.999
Even in that situation, it was my way

01:43:10.000 --> 01:43:11.999
of thanking them for understanding.

01:43:12.000 --> 01:43:12.999
Mm. >> Mm.

01:43:13.000 --> 01:43:13.999
You did well.

01:43:14.000 --> 01:43:14.999
Mm. >> You did so well.

01:43:15.000 --> 01:43:16.999
I was so proud,

01:43:17.000 --> 01:43:18.999
as a fellow member.

01:43:19.000 --> 01:43:20.999
When he pulled it off, everyone must have felt that.

01:43:21.000 --> 01:43:22.999
It was amazing. So impressive.

01:43:23.000 --> 01:43:24.999
'This is PLAVE.' As expected.

01:43:25.000 --> 01:43:25.999
Respect.

01:43:26.000 --> 01:43:27.999
But let's return

01:43:28.000 --> 01:43:29.999
to the stage discussion.

01:43:30.000 --> 01:43:30.999
The stage. Right, the stage.

01:43:31.000 --> 01:43:31.999
We already discussed all of it.

01:43:32.000 --> 01:43:34.999
As for the stage itself,

01:43:35.000 --> 01:43:36.999
I planned the cameras fairly late.

01:43:37.000 --> 01:43:37.999
I was late doing that.

01:43:38.000 --> 01:43:39.999
Watching the other members, their camerawork

01:43:40.000 --> 01:43:41.999
