01:43:42.000 --> 01:43:44.999
and impressive.

01:43:45.000 --> 01:43:46.999
But while discussing my cameras,

01:43:47.000 --> 01:43:50.999
I thought 'Sherlock' and the stage

01:43:51.000 --> 01:43:52.999
I was creating might work better

01:43:53.000 --> 01:43:56.999
without too many camera effects.

01:43:57.000 --> 01:44:00.999
If we showed it cleanly, point by point,

01:44:01.000 --> 01:44:01.999
