01:44:34.000 --> 01:44:34.999
Right, you do.

01:44:35.000 --> 01:44:36.999
I wondered what beginning, development,

01:44:37.000 --> 01:44:38.999
crisis, and resolution I could show

01:44:39.000 --> 01:44:39.999
within three minutes.

01:44:40.000 --> 01:44:40.999
What I envisioned was actually Spider-Man.

01:44:41.000 --> 01:44:41.999
Because...

01:44:42.000 --> 01:44:43.999
Really?

01:44:44.000 --> 01:44:45.999
More specifically, Spider-Man and Venom.

01:44:46.000 --> 01:44:47.999
You know Spider-Man?

01:44:48.000 --> 01:44:48.999
Yes. So...

01:44:49.000 --> 01:44:49.999
Venom is Venom, not Spider-Man.

01:44:50.000 --> 01:44:51.999
No, Spider-Man

01:44:52.000 --> 01:44:52.999
when Venom...

