Do you mean the suit?

01:44:54.000 --> 01:44:54.999
What's it called?

01:44:55.000 --> 01:44:57.999
Black-suit Spider-Man, when Venom consumes him.

01:44:58.000 --> 01:44:58.999
When he's consumed.

01:44:59.000 --> 01:45:01.999
Isn't that black Spider-Man?

01:45:02.000 --> 01:45:02.999
I think so.

01:45:03.000 --> 01:45:04.999
Ah.

01:45:05.000 --> 01:45:06.999
I can't remember the name.

01:45:07.000 --> 01:45:07.999
There is one.

01:45:08.000 --> 01:45:09.999
PLLI will know it.

01:45:10.000 --> 01:45:11.999
It's something like...

01:45:12.000 --> 01:45:12.999
Venom...

01:45:13.000 --> 01:45:14.999
You know, the name of that substance.

01:45:15.000 --> 01:45:16.999
That situation.

01:45:17.000 --> 01:45:17.999
Ah.

01:45:18.000 --> 01:45:18.999
You know what I mean?

01:45:19.000 --> 01:45:21.999
Right, right.

01:45:22.000 --> 01:45:23.999
That slippery black...

01:45:24.000 --> 01:45:24.999
