01:45:25.000 --> 01:45:25.999
An object?

01:45:26.000 --> 01:45:26.999
An objet?

01:45:27.000 --> 01:45:28.999
A symbiote.

01:45:29.000 --> 01:45:29.999
Yes, symbiote, symbiote.

01:45:30.000 --> 01:45:30.999
Symbiote.

01:45:31.000 --> 01:45:31.999
Right, symbiote. Black Spider-Man.

01:45:32.000 --> 01:45:33.999
I wanted to weave the story

01:45:34.000 --> 01:45:35.999
