01:45:45.000 --> 01:45:47.999
From Sherlock's perspective,

01:45:48.000 --> 01:45:49.999
PLLI are the flowers.

01:45:50.000 --> 01:45:52.999
As I learn and find PLLI, the flowers fully bloom.

01:45:53.000 --> 01:45:54.999
If you watch the details,

01:45:55.000 --> 01:45:55.999
