01:47:44.000 --> 01:47:45.999
I tried to express that through my movements.

01:47:46.000 --> 01:47:47.999
It was good that all five were so different.

01:47:48.000 --> 01:47:51.999
Mine was sexy. That was the sole objective.

01:47:52.000 --> 01:47:53.999
That's right. Mine was exactly that.

01:47:54.000 --> 01:47:54.999
Sexy.

